<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Chapter 32 — Caching Strategies. PostgreSQL behind Redis:
    info/   Spring's cache abstraction (@Cacheable with sync, @CacheEvict) on a transaction-aware RedisCacheManager
    menu/   item prices: cache-aside reads and write-through after commit, both "set only if newer" (Lua)
    top/    an expensive aggregation behind stale-while-revalidate with a refresh lock: no request waits for it
    views/  view counters written behind: Redis hash, claimed and flushed every second with a batch id
    verify/ the chapter's experiments (python3 standard library only)
-->
